{% comment %}
  Factory page (/pages/fabrica-alessandro-design, templates/page.factory.liquid).

  Hero on a factory photo, key figures, what buying from the maker means for the
  customer, the factory story, the film (YouTube, loaded only on click), the way a
  product travels from the technical sheet to the customer, collections and a closing
  call to action. Product pages link here from "Producator direct: vezi fabrica".

  Built on the house style of the company page: it loads assets/alc-company.css and
  reuses its alc-co__ classes; assets/alc-factory.css only adds the film, the steps
  and the reversed split.

  All copy has built-in translations for every storefront language (en.default.json is
  at Shopify's key limit). The dictionary between "case lang" and "endcase" is generated
  by seo/tools/factory-page-i18n.py; edit the texts there and run it again.
  Figures, photos, film and links are section settings; the photos fall back to the
  factory stills in Files (fabrica_2/3/5/6.jpg). Static section: the template renders it
  with {% section %}, so the page keeps its "factory" template and needs no admin change.
{% endcomment %}
